1
00:02:31,111 --> 00:02:37,111
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:37,111 --> 00:02:41,111
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:41,111 --> 00:02:45,111
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:45,111 --> 00:02:50,111
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:50,111 --> 00:02:53,111
sets sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:53,111 --> 00:02:56,111
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,111 --> 00:02:59,111
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,111 --> 00:03:02,111
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:03,111 --> 00:03:05,111
Now this is exciting!

10
00:03:06,111 --> 00:03:09,111
I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:09,111 --> 00:03:12,111
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:12,111 --> 00:03:17,111
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:20,111 --> 00:03:23,111
Separated from the rest of his crew, Luffy struggled in vain

14
00:03:23,111 --> 00:03:26,111
to rescue his brother Ace from execution at the hands of the Navy.

15
00:03:26,111 --> 00:03:33,111
In the end, both Ace and the legendary pirate Whitebeard lost their lives in the conflict,

16
00:03:33,111 --> 00:03:36,111
